[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3246.63, "timestamp": "00:54:06", "text": "Embleを手に入れるためにこれをやりたかったんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3248.39, "timestamp": "00:54:08", "text": "なぜEmbleが欲しいと思うのか、自分でもわからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3258.95, "timestamp": "00:54:18", "text": "Embleってどれくらいの値段なの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3278.79, "timestamp": "00:54:38", "text": "Embleを入手しても構わない。   でも、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3282.47, "timestamp": "00:54:42", "text": "70歳だよ。 そこが問題なんです。 それには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3285.27, "timestamp": "00:54:45", "text": "強い意志が必要だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3286.87, "timestamp": "00:54:46", "text": "ああ、"}]